---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: components::Hdr · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_reference stroke:#7B4DB2,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**components::Hdr**<br/>使相机使用高动态范围中间纹理。" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​extract::extract​_​component::**<br/>**extract​_​components#lt;bevy​_​post​_​**<br/>**process::bloom::settings::Bloom,**<br/>**bevy​_​render::RenderApp, ()#gt;**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​extract ↗：批量同步或<br/>移除子世界的目标组件。" }
  class n1 node_system
  class n1 external_node
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​render::camera::extract​_​cameras**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​render ↗：把活动相机及<br/>可见实体提取到渲染世界。" }
  class n2 node_system
  class n2 external_node
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​egui::render::extract​_​egui​_​**<br/>**camera​_​view​_​system**<br/>来自crate:bevy​_​egui ↗：为活动相机提取<br/>独立 Egui 渲染视图。" }
  class n3 node_system
  class n3 external_node
  n0 e0@-->|"存在性约束"| n1
  class e0 edge_reference
  n0 e1@-->|"存在性约束"| n2
  class e1 edge_reference
  n0 e2@-->|"存在性约束"| n3
  class e2 edge_reference
  e0@{ curve: basis }
  e2@{ curve: basis }
